	(text "BIG MODULAR HATS - S2 schematic: Bread Modular NOISE (blue) -> HIHAT on one 6HP module, two ATtiny1616 (each runs its Bread Modular firmware), 3.3 V internal signals. Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
